{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51069","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 笔法 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 笔法","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说书窗暂卧龙，神传妙诀助奇锋。\n也知外国人争学，惟恨无因乞手踪。\n（原注：南朝萧子云〖高丽本作苏子云〗善书，百济使人求手踪，以爲国宝。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}